  "instructions": [
    "For the donut milk, cut 2 large glazed donuts into pieces and combine with 500 ml whole milk. Bring gently to a light simmer over medium-low heat without scalding the milk. Let sit for about 5 minutes, blend until smooth, and double strain to remove any large pieces. Measure 3 oz of the prepared milk for one cocktail.",
    "Shake all ingredients with ice and strain into a Georgian punch glass.",
    "Garnish with freshly grated nutmeg."
  ],
